      "function": 3,
      "does": "With a gear engaged, pushing the kart along runs its one-cylinder engine: the rear axle turns the engaged clutch gear, which drives a 16-tooth gear on one of two short shafts; one shaft drives the upper shaft through a pair of 16-tooth gears, the other through an 8-tooth gear on the upper shaft's 24-tooth gear, and the 24-tooth gear turns the 12-tooth bevel gear on the crankshaft, so the piston goes up and down. One gear runs the engine three times as fast as the other; in N the engine stays still.",
